WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.200
Our Economy – Ō Tātou Ōhanga

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:13.140
Our District is home to more than 6,300 businesses

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.640
and a highly skilled labour force

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.420
however, over 40% of our working population are currently

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.480
employed outside of the District.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:29.260
Around three quarters of those would prefer to work locally if suitable work was available.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:35.360
Of the 460 hectares of land currently zoned
for business, around a hundred of that is

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.300
underutilised or vacant.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:43.960
Are we providing the right opportunities for
businesses in the right locations?

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:49.680
We need to consider what type of environments
large employers are looking for, while also

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:54.360
making Waimakariri a place where talented people want to live

00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:02.420
Our District – Our Future, Waimakariri 2048
aims to:

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:30.480
So what do you think?

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:36.480
Let us know your thoughts and find out more
about the District Development Strategy at

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:40.080
waimakariri.govt.nz

